/ActualText (Top glass cover is required to be cleaned periodically to allow the solar radiation to reach the absorber surface.)
/Pg 40 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
599 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Look for any sign of leakages in the system, in the collector, tank, and plumbing joints, and have these rectified early. Leaving leakages, unattended in insulated piping, results in corrosion of the pipes or tank.)
/Pg 40 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
600 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Check for the back-up elements/ thermostats every year before winter period and have these replaced if gone bad.)
/Pg 40 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
601 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Check for physical conditions of supports. These may be required to paint periodically to avoid corrosion.)
/Pg 40 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
602 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (If water quality is bad and unsuitable for tank material, the tank may start leaking. Check for any leakages and report for changes/replacements.)
/Pg 40 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
603 0 obj
<<
