<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (WHAT IS THE LIFE OF THE SOLAR WATER HEATING SYSTEM?)
/E (WHAT IS THE LIFE OF THE SOLAR WATER HEATING SYSTEM?)
/Pg 42 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
613 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The solar water heaters are generally expected to last 15-20 Years, but solar water heating systems installed in 83-84 are still functional in most of the places. If water quality is not a problem we can expect solar water heating systems to last easily for 30-40 years. Some preventive maintenance for protection of exposed surfaces and pumps, valves, back- up systems and plumbing etc. may be required, as for other systems in a building.)
/Pg 42 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
